<rml>
<head>
	<title>Quick Play</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="../rcss/menu.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="../rcss/play.rcss"/>
	<style>
		.qnote { margin-top: 0.75rem; }
		.foot { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; }
		/* the search, the join, or the hub's answer (rounded-sm border border-white/10 bg-black/40 px-5 py-4) */
		.qbox { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; padding: 1rem 1.25rem; background-color: #00000066; }
		.qbox .busyrow { display: flex; align-items: center; }
		.qbox .what { flex: 1 1 auto; font-size: 1rem; color: #fff3e6; }
		body.shown .qbox .what.busy { animation: 0.8s sine-in-out infinite alternate pulse; }
		@keyframes pulse { from { opacity: 1; } to { opacity: 0.6; } }
		.qbox .why { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1rem; color: #e6ddd2; }
		.qbox .acts { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
		.qbox .acts button { margin: 0 0.75rem 0 0; }
	</style>
</head>
<!--
Quick Play (PlayPages.tsx's QuickJoinPage): one mode, one button, straight into the open match with
the best connection (P8, oz_ui_social.cpp). Quick Play asks the online service for its pick in the
mode (net_quick): a close match is joined at once, with the Server Browser's join (asking the host,
connecting; Cancel gives up); a match on another continent is offered first (Join anyway); with none,
the page says why, and offers hosting the mode (Custom Match, Online), matchmaking (P8b) and the
Server Browser. A finished answer shows on the mode it was asked for, until the page opens again.
-->
<body data-model="menu">
	<div class="panel">
		<div class="corners"><div class="tl"/><div class="tr"/><div class="bl"/><div class="br"/></div>
		<div class="topline"/>
		<div class="phead">
			<div><banner text="Quick Play"/><p class="subtitle">Pick a mode and go straight into the open match with the best connection.</p></div>
			<div class="backbtn" onclick="back"><kbd>Esc</kbd><span>Back</span></div>
		</div>
		<div class="divider"/>
		<div class="pbody">
			<div class="col">
				<div class="section first"><span class="t">Game mode</span><span class="rule"/></div>
				<div class="cards">
					<div class="cell" data-for="m : quick_join.modes">
						<button class="pcard" autofocus="" data-attr-id="'qj_' + m.id" data-class-on="quick_join.mode == m.id" data-attr-onclick="quick_join.status == 'searching' || quick_join.status == 'joining' ? 'refuse Cancel the search to change the mode.' : 'set quick_join.mode ' + m.id">
							<span class="dot"/>
							<div class="q3 n">{{ m.name }}</div>
							<div class="t">{{ m.text }}</div>
						</button>
					</div>
				</div>
				<p class="note qnote">Quick Play joins open matches only: not full, no password, your game version. Your region comes first. Ping isn't measured through the relay before you join, so it's estimated from both players' regions and their connection to the online service; the real number shows in the match.</p>
				<div class="grow"/>
				<div class="box qbox" data-if="quick_join.status == 'searching' || quick_join.status == 'joining'">
					<div class="busyrow">
						<span class="what busy">{{ quick_join.text }}...</span>
						<button id="qj_cancel" class="btn small" onclick="quickcancel">Cancel</button>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="box qbox" data-if="(quick_join.status == 'far' || quick_join.status == 'none' || quick_join.status == 'failed') &amp;&amp; quick_join.asked == quick_join.mode">
					<div class="why">{{ quick_join.text }}</div>
					<div class="acts">
						<button id="qj_anyway" class="btn small primary" data-if="quick_join.status == 'far'" onclick="quickjoin">Join anyway</button>
						<button id="qj_host" class="btn small" data-class-primary="quick_join.status != 'far'" onclick="quickhost">Host a {{ quick_join.asked_name }} match</button>
						<button id="qj_queue" class="btn small" data-if="quick_join.asked == 'duel' || quick_join.asked == 'ffa' || quick_join.asked == 'tdm' || quick_join.asked == 'ctf'" onclick="soon matchmaking">Queue with matchmaking</button>
						<button id="qj_browser" class="btn small" onclick="page server_browser">Server Browser</button>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="foot">
					<div class="region">Region: <span class="ink">{{ quick_join.region }}</span><span class="faint"> (Settings, Network)</span></div>
					<button id="qj_go" class="btn primary big" onclick="quick">Quick Play</button>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
